{"candidateAnswer":"Around 1 July 2023","evidence":"[D17:4 | 1:25 pm on 9 July, 2023] Jon: Thanks! Your support and encouragement means a lot. Losing my job was a bummer, but it pushed me to take the plunge and go for my biz dreams. Started to learn all these marketing and analytics tools to push the biz forward today. It's been tricky, but I'm up for the challenge and I'm gonna make this work!","itemId":"urn:uuid:bae833aa-0e58-5a2f-b54f-4e538a73f99b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c806a7124656bfc78f9d8cfbef6f64ee826c275cac5b8381a30785cdcaf77a6c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Jon start learning marketing and analytics tools?","referenceAnswer":"July, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c806a7124656bfc78f9d8cfbef6f64ee826c275cac5b8381a30785cdcaf77a6c"}}]}